        -:    1:/**
        -:    2: * @file test_launch_detect.cpp
        -:    3: * @brief Host-side unit tests for the BNO085 launch detector
        -:    4: *        (launch_detect.cpp) with a stubbed Adafruit_BNO08x.
        -:    5: *
        -:    6: * Scripts sensor events (linear accel + rotation vector) through the
        -:    7: * stub's queue to exercise the IDLE -> DETECTING -> CONFIRMED state
        -:    8: * machine: threshold crossing, the 100 ms sustain requirement, the
        -:    9: * false-alarm drop-out, the is_launched() one-shot flag, sensor-reset
        -:   10: * re-arm, event draining, and the nav-layer accessors.
        -:   11: *
        -:   12: * Build & run:  make -C transmitter/tests
        -:   13: * Coverage:     make -C transmitter/tests coverage
        -:   14: */
